{"id":66734,"date":"2025-03-29T16:17:27","date_gmt":"2025-03-29T15:17:27","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=66734"},"modified":"2026-10-01T11:15:53","modified_gmt":"2026-10-01T10:15:53","slug":"vila-wild-trail","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/vila-wild-trail\/","title":{"rendered":"Vila Wild Trail 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Vila Wild Trail 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Vila Wild Trail 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>4 de Outubro de 2026<\/strong> (Domingo), com centro nevr\u00e1lgico, partida e meta instalados no imponente <strong>Castelo de Vilar Maior<\/strong>, no concelho do <strong>Sabugal<\/strong>, distrito da <strong>Guarda<\/strong>. Organizado pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Muralhas de Vilar Maior<\/strong>, com o apoio da C\u00e2mara Municipal do Sabugal e da Rewilding Portugal, o evento convida os atletas a explorar os cen\u00e1rios rurais e a paisagem selvagem raiana.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Podes optar entre quatro dist\u00e2ncias com partidas desfasadas na manh\u00e3 desportiva: o exigente <strong>Trail Longo de 24 km<\/strong> (partida \u00e0s <strong>09:00<\/strong>), o din\u00e2mico <strong>Trail Curto de 14 km<\/strong> (partida \u00e0s <strong>09:10<\/strong>), o acess\u00edvel <strong>Mini Trail de 9 km<\/strong> cronometrado (partida \u00e0s <strong>09:20<\/strong>) ou a c\u00e9nica <strong>Caminhada de 9 km<\/strong> (partida \u00e0s <strong>09:30<\/strong>). A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o dinamiza tamb\u00e9m o Trail das Crian\u00e7as para participantes dos 3 aos 8 anos.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Os participantes t\u00eam direito a abastecimentos l\u00edquidos e s\u00f3lidos, refor\u00e7o final, dorsal oficial com chip, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica comemorativa, medalha finisher e balne\u00e1rios para duches na aldeia hist\u00f3rica.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter